    "## 3. Pembobotan Kriteria: Analytic Hierarchy Process (AHP)\n",
    "\n",
    "### Skala Perbandingan Berpasangan Saaty (1–9)\n",
    "Sesuai hierarki kebencanaan (Human Safety First):\n",
    "Dampak Kemanusiaan (`jiwa_per_1000`) > Ketinggian Genangan (`tinggi_max_cm`) > Frekuensi & Durasi (`kejadian`, `bulan`, `lama`) > Kerentanan (`kepadatan`) > Fasilitas (`EWS`).\n",
    "\n",
    "### Pengujian Konsistensi (Consistency Ratio - CR)\n",
    "$$CI = \\frac{\\lambda_{\\max} - n}{n - 1}, \\quad CR = \\frac{CI}{RI}$$\n",
    "Untuk $n = 8$, nilai $RI = 1.41$. Matriks dinyatakan **konsisten jika $CR < 0.10$**."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "id": "eafdd23f",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "# Matriks Perbandingan Berpasangan AHP (8 x 8)\n",
    "A = np.array([\n",
    "    # JIW, TGI, KEJ, BLN, LAM, KEP, FRK, EWS\n",
    "    [1.0, 2.0, 3.0, 3.0, 4.0, 4.0, 5.0, 5.0],  # jiwa_per_1000\n",
    "    [1/2, 1.0, 2.0, 2.0, 3.0, 3.0, 4.0, 4.0],  # tinggi_max_cm\n",
    "    [1/3, 1/2, 1.0, 1.0, 2.0, 2.0, 3.0, 3.0],  # kejadian_per_tahun\n",
    "    [1/3, 1/2, 1.0, 1.0, 2.0, 2.0, 3.0, 3.0],  # bulan_banjir_per_tahun\n",
    "    [1/4, 1/3, 1/2, 1/2, 1.0, 1.0, 2.0, 2.0],  # lama_hari_mean\n",
    "    [1/4, 1/3, 1/2, 1/2, 1.0, 1.0, 2.0, 2.0],  # kepadatan_jiwa_km2\n",
    "    [1/5, 1/4, 1/3, 1/3, 1/2, 1/2, 1.0, 1.0],  # frek_tahun_banjir\n",
    "    [1/5, 1/4, 1/3, 1/3, 1/2, 1/2, 1.0, 1.0]   # n_alat_dini\n",
    "])\n",
    "\n",
    "w_ahp, l_max, ci, cr = ahp_weights(A)\n",
    "w_equal = np.ones(len(crit_cols)) / len(crit_cols)\n",
    "w_entropy = shannon_entropy_weights(X)\n",
    "\n",
    "print(\"=== HASIL EVALUASI AHP ===\")\n",
    "print(f\"Lambda Max        : {l_max:.4f}\")\n",
    "print(f\"Consistency Index : {ci:.4f}\")\n",
    "print(f\"Consistency Ratio : {cr:.4f}\")\n",
    "print(f\"Status Konsistensi: {'KONSISTEN & VALID (CR < 0.10)' if cr < 0.10 else 'TIDAK KONSISTEN'}\")\n",
    "\n",
    "weights_df = pd.DataFrame({\n",
    "    \"Dimensi\": [criteria_meta[c][\"dimensi\"] for c in crit_cols],\n",
    "    \"Tipe\": crit_types,\n",
    "    \"Bobot_AHP\": np.round(w_ahp, 4),\n",
    "    \"Bobot_Equal\": np.round(w_equal, 4),\n",
    "    \"Bobot_Entropy\": np.round(w_entropy, 4)\n",
    "}, index=crit_cols)\n",
    "\n",
    "display(weights_df)\n",
    "\n",
    "# Visualisasi Bobot AHP\n",
    "fig, ax = plt.subplots(figsize=(10, 4.5))\n",
    "weights_df[\"Bobot_AHP\"].sort_values().plot.barh(ax=ax, color=\"#2b5c8f\", edgecolor=\"black\")\n",
    "ax.set_title(f\"Bobot Kriteria AHP (CR = {cr:.4f} < 0.10 - Konsisten)\", fontsize=13, fontweight=\"bold\")\n",
    "ax.set_xlabel(\"Bobot Prioritas\")\n",
    "for i, v in enumerate(weights_df[\"Bobot_AHP\"].sort_values()):\n",
    "    ax.text(v + 0.005, i, f\"{v*100:.1f}%\", va=\"center\", fontweight=\"bold\")\n",
    "plt.tight_layout()\n",
    "plt.show()"
   ]
