   "source": [
    "## 4. Eksekusi Algoritma TOPSIS Murni\n",
    "\n",
    "Langkah TOPSIS menggunakan Bobot AHP:\n",
    "1. **Normalisasi Vektor:** $r_{ij} = \\frac{x_{ij}}{\\sqrt{\\sum_{k=1}^m x_{kj}^2}}$\n",
    "2. **Matriks Terbobot:** $v_{ij} = w_j^{AHP} \\times r_{ij}$\n",
    "3. **Solusi Ideal Positif ($A^+$) & Negatif ($A^-$):**\n",
    "   - Benefit: $A_j^+ = \\max_i(v_{ij}), \\quad A_j^- = \\min_i(v_{ij})$\n",
    "   - Cost: $A_j^+ = \\min_i(v_{ij}), \\quad A_j^- = \\max_i(v_{ij})$\n",
    "4. **Jarak Euclidean:** $D_i^+ = \\sqrt{\\sum_j (v_{ij} - A_j^+)^2}, \\quad D_i^- = \\sqrt{\\sum_j (v_{ij} - A_j^-)^2}$\n",
    "5. **Skor Preferensi Kedekatan Relatif:** $C_i = \\frac{D_i^-}{D_i^+ + D_i^-}$"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "id": "be65d112",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "# Jalankan TOPSIS dengan Bobot AHP (Bobot Utama)\n",
    "ci_ahp, d_pos, d_neg, a_pos, a_neg = topsis(X, w_ahp, crit_types)\n",
    "df_kec[\"skor_topsis\"] = ci_ahp\n",
    "df_kec[\"D_pos\"] = d_pos\n",
    "df_kec[\"D_neg\"] = d_neg\n",
    "df_kec[\"rank_topsis\"] = df_kec[\"skor_topsis\"].rank(ascending=False).astype(int)\n",
    "\n",
    "# Jalankan TOPSIS dengan bobot pembanding (Equal & Entropy) untuk analisis sensitivitas\n",
    "ci_eq, _, _, _, _ = topsis(X, w_equal, crit_types)\n",
    "df_kec[\"skor_equal\"] = ci_eq\n",
    "df_kec[\"rank_equal\"] = df_kec[\"skor_equal\"].rank(ascending=False).astype(int)\n",
    "\n",
    "ci_ent, _, _, _, _ = topsis(X, w_entropy, crit_types)\n",
    "df_kec[\"skor_entropy\"] = ci_ent\n",
    "df_kec[\"rank_entropy\"] = df_kec[\"skor_entropy\"].rank(ascending=False).astype(int)\n",
    "\n",
    "ideal_df = pd.DataFrame({\"Ideal_Positif_A+\": a_pos, \"Ideal_Negatif_A-\": a_neg}, index=crit_cols)\n",
    "print(\"Solusi Ideal Positif (A+) dan Solusi Ideal Negatif (A-):\")\n",
    "display(ideal_df.round(5))"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "1c8df199",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 5. Analisis Sensitivitas (Sensitivity Analysis)\n",
    "\n",
    "Menguji korelasi peringkat Spearman ($\\rho$) antara hasil perankingan AHP-TOPSIS terhadap skenario pembanding."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "id": "7ddc99bb",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "rho_eq, p_eq = spearmanr(df_kec[\"rank_topsis\"], df_kec[\"rank_equal\"])\n",
    "rho_ent, p_ent = spearmanr(df_kec[\"rank_topsis\"], df_kec[\"rank_entropy\"])\n",
    "\n",
    "print(f\"Korelasi Rank Spearman:\")\n",
    "print(f\"  - AHP vs Equal Weights   : rho = {rho_eq:.3f} (p-value: {p_eq:.2e})\")\n",
    "print(f\"  - AHP vs Shannon Entropy : rho = {rho_ent:.3f} (p-value: {p_ent:.2e})\")"
   ]
